provide \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeb Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e to all your customers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":null,"lastLineTextAlign":null},"defaultDataProcessed":true}}}],"title":"Homepage","uid":"21b629d4-b286-47be-a49f-256c823d6845","path":"\/homepage","autoPath":true,"authorized":true},{"type":"Page","id":"f_fd895955-3f75-4e84-8985-297f109dc6a4","sections":[{"type":"Slide","id":"3e77adab-bde3-45fd-a468-35670d0b3336","defaultValue":null,"template_thumbnail_height":80,"template_id":null,"template_name":"title","origin_id":"f_432aec76-59f0-4f18-8b18-f2278e20a7b8","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"b18eaa1f-c082-4468-b400-fe0ac59b3d21","defaultValue":null,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"name":"Privacy Policy","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"center-bottom-full","padding":{"top":"none","bottom":"none"}},"text1":{"type":"RichText","id":"a7823c12-144c-4e11-ad42-c3b14e9f77a0","defaultValue":false,"alignment":null,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-custom s-text-font-size-over-30\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePRIVACY POLICY\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4 class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-four s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eLast updated: February 8, 2025\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":null,"lastLineTextAlign":null},"defaultDataProcessed":true},"text2":{"type":"RichText","id":"61c179ee-3c0d-4827-b178-fcbded21f4d9","defaultValue":false,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1. \u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS PRIVACY POLICY\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS respects your preferences concerning the collection and use of your personal information and is fully committed to respecting and protecting your privacy and personal information. Our Privacy Policy contains important information about what personal details we collect, what we do with that information, who we may share it with and why, and your choices and rights when it comes to the personal information you have given us. We may need to make changes to our Privacy Policy, so please check the TEMPLYTICS website for updates from time to time.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e2. \u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS AND YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eYou may access TEMPLYTICS website (www.templytics.com) or any associated TEMPLYTICS website (each a website) anonymously and without revealing any personal information (except as referred to below under cookies). However, from time to time, and in order to provide you with information concerning products or services that you are interested in, TEMPLYTICS may request personal information from you either via the TEMPLYTICS website or via information that has been provided to \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ein other ways. Personal information is information that identifies an individual or relates to an identifiable individual. Personal information may include, but is not limited to: \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eYour name and physical address, email address and telephone number\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBehavioral or demographic attributes, when tied to personal identifiers\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eInformation about your company such as the name, size and location of your company and your role within the \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003emay also collect\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eOther Information through your interaction with and use of our website and which does not reveal your specific identity or does not directly relate to an individual. Other Information may include, but is not limited to:\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eUnique IDs such as a cookie placed on your computer, mobile or device ID's\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eInternet Protocol address (IP address) and information derived from your IP address such as your geographic location\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eInformation about your devices such as information contained in HTTP Headers (defined below) or other internet transfer protocol signals, browser or device type and version, operating system, user-agent strings and information about or from the presence or use of \"apps\" on your mobile devices, screen resolution, and your preferred language\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBehavioral data about your usage of our website, such as webpages clicked, websites and content areas visited, date and time of activities\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe web search you used to locate and navigate to our website\u003c\/li\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIn some instances, we may combine other information with personal information, such as deriving geographical location from your IP address and combining behavioral data about your usage of the channels with your name. If we combine other information with personal information, we will treat the combined information as personal information. As a \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ewebsite user or registrant, you are always entitled to update your personal information if necessary, ask any questions about this Privacy Policy or contact \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ewith regard to all issues related to controlling and processing of your personal data. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ewill not sell, rent or otherwise disclose this information to any third party, except as described in this Privacy Policy under section 9. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003emaintains all personal information as private to the best of the company\u2019s ability. However, personal information may be disclosed under the limited circumstances described below, and by submitting your personal information, you agree that \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS m\u003c\/span\u003eay do so. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ehas connected legal entities, business processes, management structures, and technical systems that cross borders. This Privacy Policy applies to all \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS w\u003c\/span\u003eebsites and domains.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e3. \u003cstrong\u003eCOLLECTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTo participate in certain activities and to obtain certain services or information offered on our a website, you will be asked to provide varying amounts of personal information. You understand and agree that the personal information provided by you that is collected by us via one of our websites may be held on computers in various jurisdictions around the world. In addition to the information you provide, \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003emay also collect information during your visit to a \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS w\u003c\/span\u003eebsite through automated data collection tools, which may include web beacons, cookies, embedded web links, and other commonly used information-gathering tools. These tools collect certain standard information that your browser sends to our website such as your browser type and language, access times, and the address of the website from which you arrived at a \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS w\u003c\/span\u003eebsite. They may also collect information about your Internet Protocol (IP) address, clickpath behavior (for example the pages you view, the links you click, and other actions you take in connection \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS w\u003c\/span\u003eebsites) and product information. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003emay also use some of these automatic data collection tools in connection with certain emails sent from \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003eand therefore may collect information using these tools when you open the email or click on a link contained in the email.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4. \u003cstrong\u003eHOW TEMPLYTICS USES PERSONAL INFORMATION\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003euses your personal information to better meet individual needs, to respond to specific requests for information, to improve or configure product or service specifications, and to make you aware of new or similar products or services in which you might be interested. TEMPLYTICS reserves the right to call or send registrants email communications from time to time regarding product, services and company updates, technical or administrative issues, legal notices or important information considered valuable or essential to you. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e does not intentionally send unsolicited emails to anyone who has requested that \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e should not contact them. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e will never use your personal information as part of its other commercial activities.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e5. \u003cstrong\u003eWHAT INFORMATION IS SHARED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS may share non-personal, non-individual information from which individuals cannot be identified and which do not relate to individuals in aggregate form with third parties for business purposes, such as consultants and advisors to the company. Any company that \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003eshares personally identifiable information with will have executed a confidentiality agreement, requiring that they keep all data received confidential. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003ewill not disclose personal information to any third parties without your consent except in the following very limited circumstances: \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePARTNERS AND AGENTS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003eshares information with trusted partners and agents who provide specific services you have requested and\/or administer information offered at a \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS w\u003c\/span\u003eebsite, for example, service providers who help manage, track and respond to customer inquiries, information requests, etc. \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e may also share information with authorized resellers, licensees and integration partners, who may be better suited to reply directly in response to your specific inquiries about \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS \u003c\/span\u003eproducts and services. These parties do not use or otherwise disclose any information except as authorized agents for the purpose of providing the products and services that you have requested or administering the activities on \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e's behalf or participating in joint initiatives with \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTHIRD PARTY VENDORS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe occasionally hire other companies to provide limited services on our behalf, including packaging, mailing and delivering materials, sending postal mail, processing registrations or sending emails. We will only provide those companies the information they need to deliver the service, and they are prohibited from using that information for any other purpose.\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLEGAL REQUIREMENTS AND INVESTIGATIONS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e will disclose your personal information to a third party if required to do so by law or if, in good faith, \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e believes that such action is necessary to: (1) Comply with the law or with legal process; (2) Protect and defend the company\u2019s rights and property or prevent fraud; (3) Protect the company against abuse, misuse or unauthorized use of \u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/span\u003e products or services; or (4) Protect the personal safety or property of personnel, users or the public (among other things, this means that if you provide false or deceptive registration information or attempt to pose as someone else, information about you including your computer\u2019s IP address, may be disclosed to a third party (including the recipient of an email) as part of any type of investigation into your actions. \u003c\/li\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e6. \u003cstrong\u003eIP ADDRESSES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe servers that operate TEMPLYTICS websites automatically identify a computer by its IP address. If TEMPLYTICS, in good faith, determines that you have used the service to menace, threaten, harass, intimidate or otherwise deceptively pose as another person, your actions will be investigated and your IP address may be disclosed to the recipient of any email, their legal counsel or representatives, and law enforcement officials as part of such an investigation.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e7. \u003cstrong\u003eCOOKIES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eA cookie is a small file that is saved onto your computer or other device when you visit our website. Cookies store small pieces of information. For example, they will remember you've visited our website or performed a certain action. We use cookies to help us improve your experience when you visit our website. For example, a cookie might store information so you don't have to keep entering it. Cookies also let us know which pages of our website you visited, they help us develop and market our products and services and can be in two formats: \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePersistent cookies\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThese stay valid, and will work until their expiry date (unless you delete them before they expire)\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSession cookies\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThese expire when you close your web browser\u003c\/li\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWhen you visit a website, TEMPLYTICS may place a \u201ccookie\u201d on your browser in order to improve your experience by recognizing you when you visit the website and in order to allow the company to optimize the information presented based on your demonstrated areas of interest. Cookies may also be used to compile information about website usage. This information can be used to enhance the content of a website and make your experience more informative. If you subsequently provide us with personal information such as your email address, we will associate any cookies on your browser with that information such that you will no longer be an anonymous visitor to the website. If you\u2019ve set your browser to reject cookies, you can still use our websites, but you may need to re-enter information that would normally be obtained from the cookie (for example, your email address). You can also set your browser to warn you before accepting cookies. If you do, you will receive a warning message each time the website attempts to place a cookie on your computer.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e8. \u003cstrong\u003eLINKED WEBSITES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eOur website may contain links to other websites. Please be aware that TEMPLYTICS is not responsible for the privacy practices of such other websites. TEMPLYTICS encourages users to be aware when they leave our website and to read the privacy statements of each website they visit that collects personal information. While TEMPLYTICS carefully chooses the websites to link to, this Privacy Policy applies solely to information collected on TEMPLYTICS's own websites.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e9. \u003cstrong\u003eSALE OF ASSETS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS may transfer its database, including personal information contained therein, to a third party who acquires all or substantially all of the assets of TEMPLYTICS whether by merger, acquisition, disinvestment reorganization or otherwise.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e10. \u003cstrong\u003eHOW TO OPT-OUT\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWhen you provide personally identifiable information through a form on a TEMPLYTICS website, you have the option to opt-in to receiving communication from TEMPLYTICS. If you opt-in and change your mind at any time, you may tell the company that you do not wish to receive these messages by sending an email at privacy@templytics.com or by following the \u201cUNSUBSCRIBE\u201d instructions at the bottom of any email newsletter you receive.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e11. \u003cstrong\u003eDATA PROTECTION AND INFORMATION SECURITY\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS employs administrative, technical and physical safeguards to protect against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction of the personal information you provide to TEMPLYTICS. Where one of TEMPLYTICS's partners or agents has access to or maintains sensitive personal information, the company enters into confidentiality agreements in order to ensure the privacy of such user information priori to sharing that information. Internally, access to all users\u2019 and registrants\u2019 personally identifiable information is restricted to those employees who need access in order to fulfil their job responsibilities. Servers for our websites are stored in a physically secured, offsite, facility. While the goal is to safeguard personal information, TEMPLYTICS cannot ensure or warrant the security of any transmission and your information is submitted at your own risk.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e12. \u003cstrong\u003eWHERE YOUR INFORMATION IS PROCESSED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe majority of your information is processed in The Netherlands and European Union (EU). However, some of your information may be processed by us or the third parties we work with outside of the EU, including countries such as the USA and Singapore. Where your information is being processed outside of the EU, we take additional steps to ensure that your information is protected to at least an equivalent level as would be applied by EU data privacy laws e.g. we will put in place legal agreements with our third-party suppliers and do regular checks to ensure they meet these obligations.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e13. \u003cstrong\u003eHOW LONG WE KEEP YOUR INFORMATION\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWe will keep your personal information only where it is necessary to provide you with our products or services while you are a customer or prospective customer. We may also keep your information after this period where required to meet our legal or regulatory obligations. The length of time we keep your information for these purposes will vary depending on the obligations we need to meet.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e14. \u003cstrong\u003eACCEPTANCE OF PRIVACY POLICY AND NOTIFICATION OF CHANGES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBy using a TEMPLYTICS website you signify your acceptance of this Privacy Policy, which applies to all TEMPLYTICS websites, as amended from time to time in accordance with this paragraph. If you do not agree with the content of this Privacy Policy, please do not use our website. TEMPLYTICS may revise this Privacy Policy from time-to-time and reserves the right to do so. If TEMPLYTICS decides to change this Privacy Policy, the company will post the new policy on our website. As policies are subject to change at any time and without prior notice, TEMPLYTICS encourages you to check the website whenever you might have questions or concerns. If at any point TEMPLYTICS decides to use personally identifiable information in a manner different from that stated at the time it was collected, TEMPLYTICS will notify users by way of an email to obtain their consent as a condition of doing so. You will still have the opportunity to elect not to have TEMPLYTICS use your information in this different manner. TEMPLYTICS will not use your information other than in accordance with the Privacy Policy under which it was collected absent permission to do otherwise.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e15. \u003cstrong\u003eREVIEW, MODIFY OR DELETE YOUR INFORMATION\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIf you prefer not to receive information from us or would like to update or change your personal information or preferences, follow the instructions below to review, modify or delete your personal information. To modify the information that you have provided during registration, please send an email to: privacy@templytics.com. To unsubscribe from an email, please follow the instructions in any email you receive. If you request your registration information be deleted or if you unsubscribe from communications, we may maintain information about business transactions for record keeping purposes.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e16. \u003cstrong\u003eCOMPLAINTS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIf you have a data privacy complaint, please contact us by email at privacy@templytics.com.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":"left","lastLineTextAlign":"left"},"defaultDataProcessed":true},"text3":{"type":"RichText","id":"4f6fe277-4863-4537-9d28-536bb9591146","defaultValue":null,"value":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet.","backupValue":null,"version":null},"media1":{"type":"Media","id":"b6d748f2-97cf-45cd-999c-9a1f0128a8ef","defaultValue":null,"video":{"type":"Video","id":"7effdd66-8dca-4602-8231-2f9d4307d8c2","defaultValue":null,"html":"","url":"http:\/\/vimeo.com\/18150336","thumbnail_url":null,"maxwidth":700,"description":null},"image":{"type":"Image","id":"b7d0fafc-84d5-4de6-9124-9287e8df9fb5","defaultValue":true,"link_url":null,"thumb_url":"","url":"","caption":"","description":"","storageKey":null,"storage":null,"format":null,"s":null,"new_target":true},"current":"image"},"button1":{"type":"Button","id":"b15b171e-28ac-49ba-9687-214040dd737b","defaultValue":false,"alignment":"center","text":"","link_type":"Web","size":"medium","mobile_size":"automatic","style":"","color":"","font":"Montserrat","url":"","new_target":false,"version":"2"},"background1":{"type":"Background","id":"da7bd6cc-01ee-45ff-b2e9-237ca1f311ba","defaultValue":false,"url":"!","textColor":"dark","backgroundVariation":"","sizing":"cover","userClassName":null,"videoUrl":"","videoHtml":"","storageKey":"42929\/502476_259473","storage":"s","format":"png","h":918,"w":2000,"s":293025,"useImage":true,"focus":null,"backgroundColor":null}}}],"title":"Privacy Policy","description":"","uid":"0c52bf4a-d30e-49d3-8961-6898cf0f20d4","path":"\/privacy-policy","pageTitle":"Privacy Policy","autoPath":true,"authorized":true},{"type":"Page","id":"f_1dd29a3b-1798-4968-ac1c-64c266b3af1d","defaultValue":null,"sections":[{"type":"Slide","id":"f_6d56b89a-fd79-4c65-afc0-0bd00df524b3","defaultValue":null,"template_thumbnail_height":"254.60247199999995","template_id":null,"template_name":"featureListE","origin_id":"f_42c18694-3f29-48d6-a571-e393cc44873a","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"f_922f9a0c-7dd7-4259-aaed-350753e37ea9","defaultValue":null,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"hidden_mobile_section":false,"name":"Your brand","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"normal","padding":{"top":"none","bottom":"none"},"layout_config":{"noTemplateDiff":true,"card_radius":"medium","border_thickness":"small","card_padding":"medium","spacing":"S","subtitleReplaceToText":true,"mediaSize":"l","horizontal_alignment":"center","layout":"E","border":false,"mediaPosition":"alternating","showButton":false,"border_color":"#444444","card":false,"structure":"list","card_color":"#ffffff","vertical_alignment":"middle","grid_media_position":"top","columns":"three","content_align":"center"}},"background1":{"type":"Background","id":"f_d0550bc4-e167-44d8-91a1-dab4d29539f2","defaultValue":true,"url":"","textColor":"light","backgroundVariation":"","sizing":"cover","videoUrl":"","videoHtml":""},"repeatable1":{"type":"Repeatable","id":"f_61b231fa-9c93-483e-970e-660ab9c99294","defaultValue":false,"list":[],"components":{"media1":{"type":"Media","id":"f_6f7063e8-5b56-4458-b2e8-603b41b96373","defaultValue":true,"video":{"type":"Video","id":"f_5cdde541-7580-4b9f-8740-fe1d00ec99c8","defaultValue":true,"html":"","url":"http:\/\/vimeo.com\/18150336","thumbnail_url":null,"maxwidth":700,"description":null},"image":{"type":"Image","id":"f_d2d3eec1-e0bd-4a0c-9ad4-7b2121c012f9","defaultValue":true,"link_url":null,"thumb_url":"\/\/static-assets.strikinglycdn.com\/images\/editor2\/feature_list\/thumb-list-D-1.png","url":"\/\/static-assets.strikinglycdn.com\/images\/editor2\/feature_list\/list-D-1.png","caption":"","description":"","new_target":true},"current":"image"},"text1":{"type":"RichText","id":"f_3fb6bdd1-1c79-4d1d-8903-e730fa1ab86a","defaultValue":true,"value":"What We Do","backupValue":null,"version":null},"text2":{"type":"RichText","id":"f_b4ac855d-5f8e-493b-97f5-7804a337746c","defaultValue":true,"value":"Show off your projects, features, or clients in this section.","backupValue":null,"version":null},"button1":{"type":"Button","id":"f_b612f69a-b53d-46da-93b4-300ef822d1cc","defaultValue":true,"alignment":"left","text":"Read More","size":"small","mobile_size":"automatic","style":"","color":"","font":"","url":"","new_target":null}}},"text1":{"type":"RichText","id":"f_a3f32d1a-caa5-4cc6-a434-88ce165a5a1d","defaultValue":false,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003ch2 class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-two s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color3);\"\u003eTEMPLYTICS DEMO \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003ch1 class=\" public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr font-size-tag-header-one s-text-font-size-over-40\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 48px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003eYour \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ebrand\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e. Your \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ecustomers\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\u003ch1 class=\" public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr font-size-tag-header-one s-text-font-size-over-40\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 48px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003eYour \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeb Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e. Your \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edesign\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--s-pre-color12);\"\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":null,"lastLineTextAlign":"center"},"defaultDataProcessed":true},"text2":{"type":"RichText","id":"f_a527d2b2-4d38-4198-b410-e72b4ec1180d","defaultValue":false,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003ch2 class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-two s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 28px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003eBy using \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e, you can offer your customers a state of the art \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeb Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e solution in your own company design and tailored to suit your and their needs. Your customers' reports will look like your own in-house \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeb Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #222222;\"\u003e solution and you are free to market it as such.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":"center","lastLineTextAlign":"center"},"defaultDataProcessed":true}}},{"type":"Slide","id":"f_ae7bf28d-d6ba-4ba2-bc94-ac592de6b85f","defaultValue":true,"template_thumbnail_height":175.822432,"template_id":null,"template_name":"media2","origin_id":"f_dc9ae65b-4b14-46ff-91c7-b0da49dbb9bb","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"f_1a23ece9-c40c-4a26-926a-c245e5aa31df","defaultValue":true,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"name":"How it works?","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"media-top-text","display_settings":{},"padding":{"top":"none","bottom":"normal"},"layout_config":{"isNewMedia":true,"isNewMobileLayout":true}}}},{"type":"Slide","id":"f_2887b1d8-f2c5-488c-82dd-9eb37a20657c","defaultValue":null,"template_thumbnail_height":"254.60247199999995","template_id":null,"template_name":"featureListE","origin_id":"f_42c18694-3f29-48d6-a571-e393cc44873a","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"f_f9c6d4d8-9376-45de-9808-fbc9643e1721","defaultValue":null,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"hidden_mobile_section":false,"name":"TEMPLYTICS Demo","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"normal","padding":{"top":"half","bottom":"none"},"layout_config":{"noTemplateDiff":true,"card_radius":"medium","border_thickness":"small","card_padding":"medium","spacing":"S","subtitleReplaceToText":true,"mediaSize":"l","horizontal_alignment":"center","layout":"E","border":false,"mediaPosition":"alternating","showButton":false,"border_color":"#444444","card":false,"structure":"list","card_color":"#ffffff","vertical_alignment":"middle","grid_media_position":"top","columns":"three","content_align":"center"}}}},{"type":"Slide","id":"f_05205ba4-0d9f-45d8-8c7d-decdc47fbb82","defaultValue":true,"template_id":null,"template_name":"info","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"f_a6c56ee2-ed34-4348-be2c-98d2c7695d66","defaultValue":true,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"hidden_mobile_section":false,"name":"Why work with TEMPLYTICS","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"box-three-text","padding":{"top":"half","bottom":"none"}}}}],"title":"Demo","uid":"dd0d3e56-f42b-4957-9406-11d6cb4a52de","path":"\/demo","autoPath":false,"authorized":true},{"type":"Page","id":"f_0b462b9f-eb08-4b74-a619-e099f3423d9d","sections":[{"type":"Slide","id":"ff7a7f7f-1a2b-4404-8da2-d6808f7b0a71","defaultValue":null,"template_thumbnail_height":80,"template_id":null,"template_name":"title","origin_id":"f_432aec76-59f0-4f18-8b18-f2278e20a7b8","components":{"slideSettings":{"type":"SlideSettings","id":"16f2ae85-b2e9-45b0-bfb0-32ba1759a1f0","defaultValue":null,"show_nav":true,"nameChanged":true,"hidden_section":false,"name":"Privacy Policy","sync_key":null,"layout_variation":"center-bottom-full","padding":{"top":"none","bottom":"none"}},"text1":{"type":"RichText","id":"fa5bf4a2-3fd1-4b78-8bc0-6896deeec80a","defaultValue":false,"alignment":null,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-custom s-text-font-size-over-30\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePRESS RELEASE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4 class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-four s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003eMarch 10, 2026\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":null,"lastLineTextAlign":null},"defaultDataProcessed":true},"text2":{"type":"RichText","id":"7aece162-2380-4280-882c-d7a02d0e46b2","defaultValue":false,"value":"\u003cdiv class=\"s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"display: block; \"\u003e\u003ch2 class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-two s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 28px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate-based Web Analytics provider TEMPLYTICS announces the general availability of its updated product range\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e(www.templytics.com), \u003c\/span\u003ea unique Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) provider of template-based \u003cstrong\u003eWeb Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e, today announced the general availability of its updated product range, which is already used by more than \u003cstrong\u003e300,000 websites\u003c\/strong\u003e worldwide.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArjan de Raaf\u003c\/strong\u003e (Chief Executive Officer) commented: \u201c\u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/strong\u003e is well-placed to partner with \u003cstrong\u003eWebsite Builder\u003c\/strong\u003e software, \u003cstrong\u003eeCommerce\u003c\/strong\u003e software and other template-based platforms to bring Web Analytics to all their customers or users, regardless of size. We\u2019re confident that we offer template-based Web Analytics in a way that no other available solution can today\u201d.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe technology builds on more than \u003cstrong\u003e25 years of experience\u003c\/strong\u003e. \u201cWe successfully applied this concept before, and that\u2019s why we are confident it\u2019s what the market needs\u201d.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u201cThe sign-up process is a one-time implementation, and subsequently the \u003cstrong\u003eBusiness Partner\u003c\/strong\u003e can use its own internal customer ID inside the \u003cstrong\u003eTEMPLYTICS\u003c\/strong\u003e Web Analytics engine. There is no customer interaction required, so their customers or users don\u2019t have to worry about signing up or using a third-party website to access their Web Analytics reports. They\u2019re provided through the customer dashboard of our Business Partner. White label capabilities allow our \u003cstrong\u003eBusiness Partners\u003c\/strong\u003e to brand the product any way they prefer\u201d.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u201cWith even the micro to small end of the market demanding sophisticated Web Analytics, template-based service providers are under increasing pressure to offer something more than \u2018Go get it at \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGoogle Analytics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e, it\u2019s free there\u2019 to their customers\u201d, said \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArjan de Raaf\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\" s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-small s-text-font-size-over-default\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;  \"\u003eFor more information about this press release, contact Arjan de Raaf at arjan@templytics.com, call Arjan directly at +1 (650) 980-4898 or schedule a call at www.calendly.com\/schedulingpage\/arjanderaaf\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","backupValue":null,"version":1,"lineAlignment":{"firstLineTextAlign":"left","lastLineTextAlign":"left"},"defaultDataProcessed":true},"text3":{"type":"RichText","id":"1ea9a681-e37b-472c-b953-011530